 Q 2963 1222 2963 1702 Q 2963 2355 2713 2710 Q 2464 3066 1990 3066 Q 1690 3066 1443 2928 Q 1197 2790 1030 2592 L 1030 1146 z\n\" transform=\"scale(0.015625)\"/><path id=\"LibreFranklin-Regular-6d\" d=\"M 1645 358 Q 1920 358 2173 508 Q 2426 659 2675 915 L 2675 3296 Q 2675 3392 2778 3392 L 3130 3392 Q 3219 3392 3219 3302 L 3206 83 Q 3206 0 3136 0 L 2765 0 Q 2694 0 2694 70 L 2694 448 Q 2694 480 2681 486 Q 2669 493 2637 467 Q 2285 166 2013 51 Q 1741 -64 1472 -64 Q 1178 -64 947 57 Q 717 179 582 400 Q 448 621 448 915 L 448 3290 Q 448 3392 544 3392 L 902 3392 Q 986 3392 986 3302 L 986 1056 Q 986 742 1162 550 Q 1338 358 1645 358 L 1645 358 z\n\" transform=\"scale(0.015625)\"/><path id=\"LibreFranklin-Regular-5e\" d=\"M 1914 -64 Q 1434 -64 1066 157 Q 698 378 496 771 Q 294 1165 294 1677 Q 294 2208 502 2608 Q 710 3008 1075 3232 Q 1440 3456 1920 3456 Q 2406 3456 2768 3229 Q 3130 3002 3331 2602 Q 3533 2202 3533 1683 Q 3533 1171 3328 777 Q 3123 384 2761 160 Q 2400 -64 1914 -64 L 1914 -64 z\nM 1926 339 Q 2259 339 2496 502 Q 2733 666 2857 970 Q 2982 1274 2982 1696 Q 2982 2118 2854 2422 Q 2726 2726 2489 2892 Q 2253 3059 1920 3059 Q 1594 3059 1350 2892 Q 1107 2726 976 2422 Q 845 2118 845 1696 Q 845 1280 976 973 Q 1107 666 1350 502 Q 1594 339 1926 339 L 1926 339 z\n\" transform=\"scale(0.015625)\"/></defs><use xlink:href=\"#LibreFranklin-Regular-d\"/><use xlink:href=\"#LibreFranklin-Regular-50\" transform=\"translate(72.203125 0)\"/><use xlink:href=\"#LibreFranklin-Regular-6a\" transform=\"translate(96.109375 0)\"/><use xlink:href=\"#LibreFranklin-Regular-6c\" transform=\"translate(146.015625 0)\"/><use xlink:href=\"#LibreFranklin-Regular-69\" transform=\"translate(184.71875 0)\"/><use xlink:href=\"#LibreFranklin-Regular-50\" transform=\"translate(223.015625 0)\"/><use xlink:href=\"#LibreFranklin-Regular-43\" transform=\"translate(246.921875 0)\"/><use xlink:href=\"#LibreFranklin-Regular-6d\" transform=\"translate(306.828125 0)\"/><use xlink:href=\"#LibreFranklin-Regular-6c\" transform=\"translate(364.734375 0)\"/><use xlink:href=\"#LibreFranklin-Regular-5e\" transform=\"translate(402.140625 0)\"/><use xlink:href=\"#LibreFranklin-Regular-69\" transform=\"translate(462.046875 0)\"/></g></g></g></g></g><defs><clipPath id=\"p03382624ef\"><rect x=\"47.378\" y=\"27.296\" width=\"345.96\" height=\"133.056\"/></clipPath></defs></svg>\n","title":"Exhibit 1 · Clinics signed (cumulative)","note":null},"answer":"<p>By year four the direct plan reaches 420 clinics (25% of today's addressable market); the distributor plan 500 (30%).</p> <p>Profit per clinic per year: direct ($150 − $30) × 12 = $1,440; distributor ($150 × 75% − $30) × 12 = $990.</p> <ul><li>Direct: −$235k, −$62k, +$111k, +$255k → after investment <b>−$331k</b></li> <li>Distributor: −$2k, +$147k, +$266k, +$345k → after investment <b>+$356k</b></li></ul> <p><b>So-what:</b> the distributor gives up a quarter of revenue but wins clinics faster with a much lower fixed cost; it recovers the investment within four years. Going direct doesn't.</p> <p>(Simplification: clinics count for the full year in which they're signed. Counting them only from mid-year, the distributor still ends positive and direct further behind.)</p>"},{"q":"What would you put in the distributor contract?","exhibit":null,"answer":"<ul><li><b>Minimum clinic targets</b> each year, with HelioVet's right to go direct if they're missed</li> <li><b>Customer data and contracts</b> owned by HelioVet, so it keeps the relationships</li> <li><b>Training and first-line support</b> by the distributor; HelioVet handles software issues</li> <li><b>Time limit</b> (e.g. 3 to 5 years) on exclusivity</li></ul>"}],"reco":"Enter Poland through the distributor. Poland has about 1,680 clinics able to use HelioVet today; the distributor reaches them faster at a far lower fixed cost, delivering +$356k cumulative after the $400k investment over four years versus −$331k going direct. Protect the long term with minimum targets, HelioVet-owned customer contracts and time-limited exclusivity. Risk: dependence on one partner. Next step: negotiate terms with the distributor and pilot in Warsaw.","great":["Sizes the addressable market from digital adoption","Compares entry modes over time, not at steady state","Sees that speed and fixed cost outweigh the margin given up","Protects the client in the partner contract"],"id":39,"slug":"heliovet"}